  "data": {
    "summary": "Against a PSYKER target, apply Devastating Wounds on a Critical Wound. Bypass saves and deal the attack’s Damage as mortal wounds, counting Melta and any Damage bonus from the Critical Wound. Resolve this after ordinary damage. Excess stays off other models. Feel No Pain can still prevent wounds, including rolls limited to mortal wounds.",
